  "reasoning": "The defendant operated two hot pot restaurants and sold large quantities of meat that was past its expiration date. This constitutes the illegal sale of food that does not meet safety standards, which under Chinese criminal law is the crime of ‘生产、销售不符合安全标准的食品’. No other criminal conduct (e.g., fraud, theft) is indicated in the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]生产、销售不符合安全标准的食品<eoa>"
